3. PRIVACY

Keep stores and processes document content and queries on the computer
that runs the server. Keep does not send document content, queries,
license data, usage telemetry, or crash reports to the Licensor.
Lexical search works without network access. If you enable semantic
search and its model is absent, Keep downloads pinned model files from
the documented third-party model source. If you expose Keep through a
proxy, you control that connection and its data.

